# forge-control repo — versions ONLY the forge control plane
# (CLAUDE.md, agents/, tasks/, questions/, .claude/, tests/Features/)
#
# All 11 application sub-repos and orphan tooling are excluded so this repo
# never accidentally swallows code from another git repo.

# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. Re-include forge control plane
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!MEMORY.md

!.claude/
!.claude/**
# never commit machine-local Claude settings
.claude/settings.local.json

!agents/
!agents/**

!tasks/
!tasks/**

!Docs
!Docs/**

!questions/
!questions/**

!.windsurf/
!.windsurf/**
# never commit machine-local Windsurf settings (e.g. MCP secrets)
.windsurf/mcp.local.json

# .feature files are PO property (CLAUDE.md rule 1a) — keep them under forge-control
!tests/
tests/*
!tests/Features/
!tests/Features/**
# Playwright e2e tests (cross-repo, scaffolded by /qa) — track config + specs,
# leave node_modules / playwright-report / test-results to E2E's own .gitignore.
!tests/E2E/
!tests/E2E/**
tests/E2E/node_modules/
tests/E2E/playwright-report/
tests/E2E/test-results/
tests/E2E/blob-report/
tests/E2E/playwright/.cache/

# Belt-and-braces: never track anything inside the 11 application sub-repos,
# even if a future glob change re-includes them.
Api/
Client/
Dtos/
Sdk/
Host/
DevOps/
interop/
psc/
Tools/

# Forge instrumentation (task-level timing) — tooling + append-only ledger.
# `Tools/` is otherwise orphan tooling and stays untracked ; only the timing
# harness is forge infrastructure and must survive a fresh clone.
#
# CASSE : le répertoire s'appelle bien `Tools` (majuscule) sur le disque. Le
# système de fichiers étant insensible à la casse, un motif en `tools/` semble
# fonctionner mais `git` enregistre le chemin réel — d'où des chemins cassés sur
# un clone sensible à la casse. Toujours écrire `Tools/`.
#
# Ce bloc doit rester APRÈS la ligne `Tools/` ci-dessus : le dernier motif qui
# matche gagne.
!Tools/
Tools/*
!Tools/timing/
!Tools/timing/**

# The ledger is the forge's measurement journal (committed, append-only).
# The .state/ markers are machine-local run state and must never be tracked.
!metrics/
metrics/*
!metrics/timings.jsonl


# Secrets � never commit
.env
*.env
!.env.example
